DreamThrobber:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamThrobber.h#DreamThrobber:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect."
    text  "本实例自身的外观。只要StyleSource如此指定且样式表\n确实存在，项目样式表就优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这里就是实际生效的外观。"
    state machine
}

